  //
  // ROUND 355: the sections were the prompt corpus AND the persona blocks (docs/26 section 3.7).
  //
  // ROUND 374 - CORRECTED AFTER AN INDEPENDENT AUDIT READ THE PACK FILE BY FILE. The corpus and the persona are
